title: 'C-c m b p : skg-mark-both-processed'
pid: 1c86373f-3113-43d1-9051-4f5afccad764
body: |2-
  Marks processed both the node at point and its relationship to the
  headline above it, then saves: everything the headline shows. With
  C-u (or C-u C-u), everything in the subtree, as above. Below a new
  node only the server's walk marks, and it reaches new nodes alone: an
  existing node drawn there keeps its own changes unmarked until marked
  where it stands.
